    "notes": [
      {
        "id": 3954482998,
        "type": null,
        "body": "Planned as phase 3 of [Object save fixes and arm pricing](https://gitlab.com/max757/Luminari-Source/-/blob/master/docs/ongoing-projects/object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing.md).\n\nIt runs after #18, which makes the tests of `unittests/CuTest/test_database_persistence.c` pass alone on a `master_schema.sql`-only database, and before #16 and #17, which also change what happens when an object is extracted or freed.\n\nIts `15-` branch is created from master when the phase starts. The work runs in the worktree `Luminari-Source-object-save-fixes-and-arm-pricing`, now on phase 1 (#19).",
        "author": {
          "id": 42759441,
          "username": "max757",
